<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="ECC" style="id">Thugenpa</book>
  <para style="h">Thugenpa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Thugenpa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Thugenpa</para>
  <para style="mt">Thugenpa</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jerusalem leengpa David tapa thugenpa thute.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bangmaloute bangmalou, bangkim abawn in bangmaloute bangmalou ahi bou hi chi’n thugenpa’n agen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mihingin nisa nuoi a anasepgimna zousie apat bang alawtaah ei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khangkhat abei a, khangdang khat ahing um zel a, hinanleh leitung pen angaingai in kumtawn in a umden hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ni ahing suoh a, tualeh atum zel hi, tualeh kintah in ahing suohna mun lam atungkia pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hui khu simlangah alaanga, tualeh mallam a kihei in akiviel tou a, tualeh akuol in alaang kawi kawi a, alaanna lampi ngaima ah a nuakia kia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lui zousie tuipi ah aluonglut a, hinanleh tuipi adim tuom sih hi; luituite ahing kipatna nah lam ah anua luonkie zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bangma zousie lunggimna a dim ahia, mihing gen sanga lunggim huoi zaw ahi; mit lah asilmu ah alungkim ngai sih a, ahisihleh bil zong azah ah alungkim tuom sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ana umsa silte ma hing um kia ding ahi a, a kibawl zousate ma kibawl kia ding ahi, tuazieh in ni nuoi ah bangma atha a um sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“En vawi un,” tami sil tha ahi chi ding a um ei mah? Tamte ni danglai a, eihaw um masanga na umsa ngen ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nidanglai a sil masate theizingna a um sih a, ahing um ding hi in, ahing umtou zel dingte nangawn theizingna a um tuom sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kei thugenpa Jerusalem a Israelte leengpa kana hita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh pilna in vannuoi a sil kibawl zousie tungtang sui ding leh theichien dingin ka lungsim kana mangta a, tuachi’n Pasian in tami gimna nasep nasatah khu mihing tate kungah buoipi dingin ana peta hi, chi ka theita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bangkim ni nuoi a kibawl nasep zousie ka muta a, tualeh ngai in, abawn in bangmalou ahia hui nuadel toh kibang giap ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Akawisa lah zezang thei ahi nawn sih a, akimlou lah sim thei ahisih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Keima leh keima ka kihou a, “Ngai vawi, ka masanga Jerusalem a vaihawma na pangte sangin pilna leh theina ka nei zaw hi,” chi’n ka kingaisut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh pilna thei ding leh motna leh mot gamtatna theina dingin ka lungsim kana zanga, tamte zousie hui nua del bang mai ahi giap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aziehpen Pilna atam sem sem leh gentheina asang sem sem a, tualeh theina atam sem sem leh gentheina atam sem sem hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka lungsim in “Kisa in, nopsahna in ka hing en chien ding, nopsahna in noptaal in,” ka chi a, hinanleh nopsahna zong bangmalou ahi veve hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nuina lah “Mothuoina” ahi giap a, nopsahna in “Bang ahiei alawtah?” ka chita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mihing taten adamsung tomnoukhat sunga vannuoi a abawl ding uh silhoi pen bang ahiei mah, chi ka mu theina dingin, ka lungtang pilna zangin zu a kei leh kei kipah sah tum a ka kingaituo leh, motna tu chinten ka hi dan ka lungtangin asuidohta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na thupitah ka sem a, keima a dingin innte kana lam a, grep huonte ka bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Keima ding huon leh thei huonte ka bawl a, khunah thei kung namkimte ka suon a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />ka theikung suon hing khangdohte tui buohna dingin tuikulte ka bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Suohnu leh suohpate ka lei a, tualeh ka innsunga pieng suoh dangte zong ka nei hi. Ka masanga Jerusalem a na um zousiete sangin bawnghonte leh belam honte ka hauzaw nalai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sana leh dangka zong keima dingin ka khawm a, leengte leh gamkaite akipat goute ka lakhawm hi. Mihingte kipahna Pasal leh numei lasa siemte leh tam lasahna vanjah ding tampi zong ka nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n ka masanga Jerusalem a na um masate zousie sangin ka thupi zaw tham a, ka pilna zong keima toh a um den hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka mitin alunggul pouma neila ka nei sih a, nopsahna pouma akipat ka lungtang ka tutang sih a, ka sepgimna zousie ah ka lungtang akipah ziehin, tami ka sepgimna kipahman ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n ka khut a ka sepkhiet zousie leh ka sepgimna zousie ka et chiengin, ngai vawi bangma zousie bangmalou aguohtangpi ahibou a hui nuadel bang giap ahi bou hi. Ni nuoi ah bangma lawtah ding a um sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n pilna, motna leh mot huoinate ngaisut ding in ka lungsim ka hei a, leengpa nua a hing um ding mihingin akibawlsate ban ah, bang bawl thei tuom ding ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n khomiel sangin khovah ahoi zaw a, motna sangin pilna ahoizaw hi, chi, ka mukheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mipil mit khu alungtangah a um a, hinanleh mi mo pen miel lah ah avah hi. Hinanleh, sil tung khat poupou ani ua tungah atung hi chi, ka mudohta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n ka lungsim in keima leh keima ka kihou a, mi mo tunga tung “Bangin kei tungah zong hing tung ding ahi a, bangzieh a kei pil zaw ka hiei?” Ka kichi hi, tuachi’n ka lungsim in, tamte zong bangmalou ahi, ka chita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aziehpen mipil mi mo sanga kumtawn a thei den zawhna a um tuom sih a, ahing tung ding hun leh nite ah ani ua manghil a um ding ahi uh, chi thei in. Tualeh bangchi dan a mi mo zong mipil bang a shi ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuaziehin hinna ka huo hi, ni nuoi a sil kibawl zousie kei a dingin lunggimna ahi ziehin; tuate zousie bangmalou ahi a, hui nuadel bang giap ahibou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n ni nuoi a ka sepgimna a ka silbawl sate, ka nua a hing um ding midangte nuasie ding ka hi ziehin van nuoi a ka sepgimnate zong ka muda hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Koi ahiei ka nua a hing um ding khu mipil ahi ding leh, mimo ahi ding thei? Hinanleh ka sepgimna a ka nasep zousie tungah leh ni nuoi a ka kipil sahna zousie vai ahing hawm khum nalai ding hi. Tami zong bangmalou ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuaziehin ni nuoi a ka sepgimnate zousie lungkieh huoi sa in ka lungtang ka leheita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Aziehpen mi’n pilna, theina leh siemna toh nna asem a, tuate sem khalou midang khat tanvou dinga a nuasie pieh ding ahi. Tamte zong bangmalou leh nasatah a, hoilou ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mi’n ni nuoi a asepgimna zousie leh alunggimpi akipat bang ahiei anei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Aziehpen adamsung nite zousie lunggimna leh gentheitah a nasepna tualeh zanlai nangawn in alungsim atawldam sih hi. Tami zong bangmalou ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mi’n asepgimna aneh a, adawn a, tualeh ahinna alungkim sah kaan a hoizaw bangma aum sih hi. Tamte zong Pasian khut a kipat a hing um ahi chi ka mudohta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Aziehpen kei sanga ne thei zaw koi ahiei um, ahisihleh koi ahiei kei sanga nuomsa zaw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Aziehpen Pasian in ama mitmu a hoite kungah pilna, theina leh, lungnopna apie hi, hinanleh mikhielte kungah pen, Pasian masanga mi hoite kunga apieh theina dinga, lakhawm ding leh kholkhawm dingin sepgimna apie hi. Tamte zong bangmalou leh hui nuadel bang giap ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sil chintenga dingin hun a um chiet hi. Vannuoi a siltup chintenga dingin, hun khat a um chiet hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pien hun a um a, shi hun a um hi. Suon hun a um a, Suon sate bawdoh hun a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tha hun a um a, suhdam hun a um hi. Phekhiet hun a um a, lam hun a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kaa hun a um a, nui hun a um hi, daa hun a um a, laam hun a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Suongte paimang hun a uma, suongte lahkhawm hun a um hi kikawi hun a um a, kihakhiet hun a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sil sui hun a um a, mansuo hun a um hi, sil kep hoi hun a um a, paikhiet hun a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bawkeh hun a um a, khuikhawm hun a um hi. Sip dide hun a uma, ham hun a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ki it hun a um a, ki muda hun a um hi. Kidou hun a um a, kilem hun a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na sempa’n asepgimna apat bang phattuomna anei ei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pasian in mihingte kunga buoipi dinga ana pieh sepgimna khu ka muta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pasian in sil zousie ahun chiet ua dinga hoi leh kilawm in asiem a, Aman mihingte lungtang ah tangtawn akoi nalai a, hinanleh achiil apat atawp donga Pasian in abawlte koiman amudoh louna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mihingte a dingin adamsung ua dinga kipahna leh silhoi abawl uh kaan a hoizaw bangma a um sih, chi ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh michin in aneh a, adawn a, asepgimna silhoi zousie nuomtah a aman ding ahi; tua khu Pasian silpieh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pasian in abawl pouma tangtawn a um ding ahi, chi ka thei hi. Bangma akibelap thei sih dinga tualeh bangma akiladoh thei sih ding hi. Mihingten Pasian agiin theina ding ua Aman tambanga abawl ahi, chi ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tulaitah a sil umte khu ana um zousa ahi a, ahing um dingte zong ana umzousa ahita hi; Tualeh Pasian in ana umzousate asuidoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuathamlouin ni nuoi a vaihawmna mun ah gitlouna a um a, tualeh dihtatna umna mun ah thulimlouna zong a um hi chi ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka lungsim in, Pasian in midihtat leh migiloute tungah thu akhen tuohtuoh ding hi, Aziehpen siltup chinteng leh nasep chintenga dingin hun guotsa um chiet hiven chiin ka geeldoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mihing tapate tungtang thu ah amauh mama khu gamsa bang bep ahi uh, chi akitheina dingun Pasian in amaute a enchien hi, chi’n ka lungtangin ka ngaisut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aziehpen mihing tapate tunga sil tung khu gamsate tungah zong atung hi; ani ua tungah tawpna kibang atung dinga, khat ashi leh adangte zong ashi hi; abawn un nahna hu kibang anei ua, mihingin ganhing tungah hamphatna anei tuom sih hi; aziehpen sil zousie bangmalou ahibou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A bawn un mun khat ah apei ua, abawn un leivui a kisiem ahi ua, abawn un leivui ah a kia kia zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mihing hagau tunglam ah apeitou a, gantate hagau lei nuoi langah apeisuh hi, chi koi ahiei athei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuaziehin mihing ama nasep a alungkim kaan a hoizaw bangma a um sih, chi ka mukheta hi; aziehpen tua khu ama tanvou ahi a, anua a bang hing um ding ahiei chi, mu dingin ama koiin ahing pui diei?
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n ka kihei a, ni nuoi a kibawl gentheina zousie ka ngaituo a, suhgenthei a umte hitui ka mu a, hamuon ding mi a nei sih uhi. A langkhat ah amauh sugentheiten thuneina anei ua, suhgenthei a umte’n hamuon ding anei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh mihing ahing nalaite sangin ana shisa mishite ahampha zaw uhi, chi’n ka ngaituo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amautegel sangin zong apieng nailoute, ni nuoi a silhoilou kibawl mukha nailoute ahampha zaw nalai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuaban ah sepgimna zousie leh, nasep siemna chinteng khu, innvengten a enna zieh a hing piengdoh ahi, chi, ka muta hi. Tamte zong bangmalou ahi a, hui nuadel bang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi mo in akhut aphan a, ama tahsa ane hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sepgimna toh khut lang ni dim a hui mat sangin, lungmuong tah a khut khat dim nei ahoi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n ka kihei a, ni nuoi a bangmalou ka muta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mi khat lawm le guol neilou amatanga um khat a um hi; Aman tapa leh sanggam anei sih hi; khuchi hinapiin asepgimna in tawp hun anei sih a, amittegel lah ahausatna ah alungkim tuom sih hi. Hinanleh “Koi a dinga semgim a, ka nopsah na ka taanlaw a hiei?” achi ngai tuom sih hi. Tami zong bangmalou ahi a, lunggimna bou ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Khat sangin ni ahoizaw hi. Aziehpen asepgimna uh kipahman hoitah amu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aziehpen khat apua chiengin a lawm in aphong thei hi. Aphong ding neilou a pua mi hepihuoi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachiengin, mi ni alupkhawm uleh lum asa ua; hinanleh mi khattanga lum in bangchin lum asa thei diei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi khat pen midang khat in zou nanleh; mi ni azou sih ding hi. Tualeh khauhuol zang thum a kiheh zong atan meng meng sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lengpa tehtah leh, motah thuhilna sang thei nawnlou sangin, tangval genthei leh piltah ahoizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aziehpen suong kul akipat in leeng ding ahing pei a, Ahi, ama gam mama a gentheisa a pieng hinanleh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ni nuoi a hinna nei vahthei zousie in, leengpa thahenga leenga hing pang ding, tangval ninapa azui uh chi ka muta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mi zousieleh amaute masanga, leeng ana kibawlna mipite tawp chi a um sih hi. Hinanleh anua chienga hing um ding zong miten, akipahpi tuom sih ding uhi. Tami zong bangmalou ahi a, huimut bang giep ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pasian inn a na haw chiengin, pilvang tah in na kalsuon in; Sil bawlkhiel ahilam uh kitheilou mi mote, kithoina bang kithoina lat sangin, thungaikhe dingin kuon zaw in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na kam lawpsah seng sinlen, tualeh Pasian masanga thugen dingin, na lungtang kinawsah sin. Aziehpen vantunga um ahia, nang pen leitunga um na hi, tuaziehin thu gen tawm zaw in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aziehpen mang khu, lunggimna tampite zieh a hing um ahia, tualeh mi mo aw pen athugen tam ziehin akithei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pasian kunga thuchiem na bawl chiengin, tangtungsah dingin kihalsah sin; aziehpen Aman mimote ah kipahna anei sih hi; na thuchiem tangtungsah pai in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thuchiem bawl a tangtunlou sangin, thuchiem bawllou ahoizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na kam in na tahsa khielsah sih henlen, tualeh Pasian sawltahte kungah ka thuchiem bawlte, ka bawlkhiel khata hi chi sin. Bangzieh a na kamtengkhat a Pasian lungthah sah a na khut nasep suse ding na hiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aziehpen mang tampi leh thu tampi zong bangmalou ahi. Hinanleh nangman Pasian giingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Gamsung a mi zawng gentheite suhgenthei leh hiemngamnain thudih leh dihtatna aheimang na mu leh lamdang sa sin, aziehpen Ulienten uliente aveng ua, tualeh amauh sanga sangzaw a um nalai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hinanleh zong gamsunga piengte mi zousie a ding ahi a, tualeh leengpa zong agam leitanga piengin akivah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Koipou dangka dei mi khu, dangka in alungkim sih ding a, punna tampi toh hausat tumte zong, alung kim ngai sih ding hi. Tami zong bangmalou ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nei leh lam apun chiengin, aneding zong apung zel hi, tualeh aneipa a dingin amit a a et chiloungal, bang phattuomna a um ei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ne tawm in ne tam taleh nasem mi a imut anuom a, hinanleh mi hausa pen ahausatna in a imu sah thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ni nuoi a sil hoilou mama ka mu khat a um hi, hausatna khu aneipa a dinga sietna tuntu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hinanleh tua hausatnate pen, vangsietna ziehin amangthangta hi; tualeh tapa anei a akhut sungah bangma a um sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Anu gilsunga kipat a saguoh a ahing pien mabangin, saguoh ma in akia kia dinga, asepgimna ga bangma akeng thei sih dinga, akhut in zong bangma atawidoh thei sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tami zong sil hoilou vawt khat ahi, ahing pei bang ngelngel in anua pei kia ding hi. Tualeh hui dinga asepgimna ah, bang alawtah ei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Adamsung nite zousie ah miellah ah ann ane a, tualeh lunggimna, natna leh, lungthahna toh athuoh nalai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />En in, ka sil mu khat tami ahi: Pasian in mihinga dinga damsung ni tomnou apieh sunga aneh a, adawn a, ni nuoi a asepgimna a, alungkim leh ama a dingin ahoi ahi. Aziehpen tuami ama tanvou ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pasian in michin kunga hausatna leh nei leh lam apiehte ne ding leh agoutante la dingin, tualeh anasepgimna gate a kipah dingin thuneina apie hi. Tami Pasian silpieh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aziehpen Pasian in tuabang mite lungkimtah a akoitah ziehin, adamsung nite anua suikia sese nawn sih hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ni nuoi a ka mu sil hoilou khat a uma, tua sil hoilou khu mihingte adingin agih mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mihingte kunga Pasian in hausatna leh nei leh lam leh zatatnate apie a, alunggul pouma bangma tasap anei sih hi. Hinanleh tuate nuomtah a ne dingin Pasian in ama thuneina ape sih a, hinanleh gamdang miten ane khawng zaw uhi. Tami bangmalou leh suhgentheina hoilou ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mi khat in tapa zakhat nei henlen, kum tampi dam in, adam sung kumte tam mama nanleh, ahinna silhoi a lungkim louin, hoitah nangawn a vui alaw sih leh ama sangin ahun lou a apieng naungehte ahampha zaw hi, ka chi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama bangmalou in ahing pienga, miellah ah apeimang pai a, amin zong mielin akhu khum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aman ni lah mulou, bangma lah theilou, hitamananleh khatpa sangin aman khawldamna amu zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kum tul khat leni dam nanleh, silhoi amu tuom sih leh bang phatuom ahiei? Mi zousie tunna kibang mun khat a pei uh hilou amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mihing sepgimna zousie akam a ding ahia, hinanleh ahinna alungkim thei tuom sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aziehpen mipil in mimo sangin, bang phattuomna anei tamzaw a ahiei? Mi zawngin bang anei a, mihing masanga akhohei dan thei migenthei in, bang amu a ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lunggulna tapvah sangin, mit a mu thei sil ahoizaw hi. Tami zong bangmalou hui mut bang giap ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Sil hing um khat pou khu min phuosa ngen ahi a, mihing ahi chi akithei hi. Ama sanga hatzaw toh akihau thei sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bangmalou tamsah sil tampi a um hi chi thei in; mihing bang chidan a hoi tuom ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aziehpen mihing damsunga dinga hoi koiin athei ei? Ama lah damsung ni tomnou a dinga pannabei limliep banga pei ahi a, ama um nawnlou nua chienga ni nuoi a sil hing um ding koi in mihing ahil thei diei?
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Min hoi khu kinuna sathau gimnamtui, manphatah sangin ahoi zaw a, pien ni sangin shi ni ahoi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pawi bawlna inn a haw sangin, lu suunna inn a haw ahoizaw hi; Aziehpen shina pen mizousie tawpna ahi a, adam nalaiten alungtang uah akoi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nuina sangin dana ahoizaw hi, aziehpen lungtanga dingin da mel ahoi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mipilte lungtang lu suunna inn ah aum a, mi mote lungtang pen nopbawlna inn ah a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mimote lasah ngaikhieh sangin, mipilte phawhhilna ngaikhieh ahoizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aziehpen mi mote nui, bel nuoi a ling poh phek phek bang ahi a, tamte zong bangmalou ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Adihtah in nuoisiena in mipil ngaisutna asusie a, golguhna in lungtang asesah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sil zousie akipatna sangin atawpna ahoizaw a, kisahtheina sangin dawzawna ahoizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lungthah bai dingin na lungsim kinawsah sin, aziehpen lungthahna khu mi mote angsung ah a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Bangzieh a tulai nite sanga, nidanglai nite hoi zaw ahiei?” Chi sin; aziehpen tamte pilvangtah a kanchien na hi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pilna khu gouluo tuh a hoi ahi a, ni mute a dingin phattuomna aum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Dangka sum kiven bitna ahi bangin, pilna zong kivenbitna ahi. Hinanleh theina hoidan ahileh, pilnain ama neimite, hinna apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pasian nasep ngaituo in, Aman akawi a abawlsa, koiin abawl tang thei diei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lawchin ni chiengin kipah inlen, Hinanleh vangsiet ni ahing tun chiengin tami ngaituo in, Pasian in khat abawl bangin adang zong abawl hi. Tuachia mihingin anua a sil hing um ding, bangma amu theilouna dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka damsung nite bangmalou sungah, silzousie ka na muta a, midih adihtatna abeimanga, tualeh migilou agitlouna toh adamsung suhsau in a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kidihtatsah seng sinlen, kipil sah seng sin, bangdinga nang leh nang kisuse ding na hiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Gilou seng sinlen kimosah seng sin; Bangzieh a na hun tun masanga shi ding na hiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tami na tuhdet chinten ahoi hi, adang zong hasuolou ahoi hi. Aziehpen Pasian giing pouma, tuate zousie akipat in asuohta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Khopi sunga vaihawm sawm sangin, pilna in mi asuhat zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aziehpen silhoi bawla khiellou, midih khat zong leitungah a um sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mi thugen zousie na lungtang ah vom sin, na suohin ang hamsietna na zakha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Aziehpen nang zong midangte tamveipi na hamsietta hi, chi nangman zong na lungtangin na thei leng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Pilna zangin tamte zousie kana enchienta hi; “Pil tavang” ka chi a, hinanleh kei bawlthei guol ahisih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Bangteng hitaleh pilna pen agam a gamla, athuh a thuh ahi a, koi in amudoh thei diei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Pilna leh sil zousie hing umna azieh, theichien ding leh suikhe dingin ka lungsim ka zangta a, gitlouna mothuoi dan leh, motna ngolhuoi dan theikhe ding in zong, ka lungtang ka zang ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Shina sanga khazaw sil ka mu pen, numei lungtang thang leh len kikamsa ahi a, akhutte khu siakol bang mai ahi; koipou Pasian kipahsah mi khu amanu apat asuohta dinga, hinanleh mikhielte pen mat in aum, ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />En vawi, tami ka mudoh ahi, thugenpa’n achi hi. Sil zousie ahinatah azieh mukhe dingin, khat khat in ka suichien hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuakhu ka hinna in asui nalai a, hinanleh ka mu sih hi. Mi tul khat lah ah pasal khat ka muta a, hinanleh amaute zousie lah ah numei khat zong ka mu sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Adihtahin ka mukhiet sun tami ahi. Pasian in mihing adih in abawl a, hinanleh amaun bawlthu tampi asuikhie uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Koi ahiei mipil toh kibang? Tualeh silte hilchiena thei koi ahiei? Pilna in mihing mel ataang sah a, Tualeh amaigumna akiheng sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka hing hil ahi: Pasian kunga na kichiemna ziehin, leengpa thupieh zui in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Leengpa mitmu apat pawtkhe dingin kinaw seng sin, sil hoilou lam hum in pang tei tei sin, aziehpen aman a ut pouma abawl zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Leengpa thu umna phot ah, sil bawltheina a um hi. Koiman akungah “Bang ahiei na bawl?” achi thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thupieh zui poumaten silhoilou atheikha sih dinga, tualeh mipil lungtangin hun leh vaihawmna atheikhen zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aziehpen mihing lunggimna atungah nasatah in kibelap nanleh, sil zousie in ama hunbi leh vaihawmna anei chiet hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aziehpen bang hing um ding ahiei chi aman athei sih hi. Tuaziehin sil hing tung ding koiin ama ahil thei diei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hagau hentang dinga hagau thuneina nei koima a um sih a, shi niin zong koiman thuneina anei sih hi. Galdou sungin khawl a um sih a, gitlouna in gitlouna bawl mite asuohta sah sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ni nuoi a sil kibawl zousie ngaituoin lungsim ka senga, tamte zousie ka mu hi; mihingin ama sietna ding bepin midang tunga athunei hun a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n migiloute ki vui ka mu zel a, amaute mun siengthou a haw a peikiate ahi ua, silgilou abawlna khopi miten amanghilta uhi. Tami zong bangmalou ahibou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tatsietna tunga gawtna kitungsah pailou ahi ziehin mihingte lungtang khu silgilou bawl ding in ama uah suhat in a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Migilou in silgilou zakhat vei bawl in adamsung nite uh suhsau in um nanleh, Pasian giing a, Ama masanga zaudan siem mite a dingin ahoizaw ding chi ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hinanleh migilouten Pasian agiinlou ziehun amauh tan ahoi sih dinga, adamsung nite uh limliep abang dinga, asawt sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bangmalou leitunga bawla um aum hi. Tua pen, migiloute nasepna dungzui a migiloute tan dinga kilawm midihtatten atan khah uh a um a, midihtatte tan dinga kilawm migilouten atan khah u’zong a um hi, tami zong bangmalou ahi, ka chi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuaziehin mihing in aneh a, adawn a, tualeh nuomtah a aum sanga hoizaw ni nuoi a umlou ahi ziehin, damsung nopsahna mama ka genphata hi. Pasian in ni nuoi a damsung nite apieh sunga asepgimna lungnopna in zui ding ahi ziehin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pilna thei ding leh leitunga kibawl nasepte mu tum a ka lungtang ka senlai in, sun leh zan a mittung mitmuoi singlou mi a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n Pasian nasep zousie ka muta a, ni nuoi a ana kibawl, nasep zousie mihingin amudoh thei sih hi, suidoh ding in nasatahin pang nanleh amu tuomlou ding ziehin, tuathamlou in mipil in thei tum ngong nanleh amudoh zou tuom sih ding hi, chi ka muta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tamte zousie phuongdoh dingin ka lungtang sunga koi in ka ngaituo a, midihtatte leh mipilte tualeh asilbawlte uh Pasian khut a um ahia, itna hiin mudana hitaleh amasang ua atuoh ding ua sil um zousie bangmalou ahi chi koiman athei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mi zousie mi dihtat leh migilou asie leh apha, asieng leh asienglou kithoina sillat bawlte leh, abawlloute atawpna uh kibang ahi. Mihoi tunga tung bang bang mikhiel tungah atung hi. Kichiemna bawlte tunga, tung bangbang kichiemna bawlngailoute tungah atung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ni nuoi a kibawl sil zousiete lah ah tami sil hoilou khat ahi: tua khu mi zousie tunga tawpna akibang chiet a tung khu ahi. Adihtah in mihingtapate lungtang khu gitlou in adim a, adamsung un motna alungtang uah a um a, tuazou chiengin mishite kungah apei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hinanleh ahing nalaite toh kizop pouma in lam etna anei hi, aziehpen humpibahnei shisa sangin ui hinglai ahoizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aziehpen ahing nalai ten zong, shiding ahi uh chi akithei ua, hinanleh mishi in bangma athei sih hi; kipahman zong anei nawn sih uhi. Amaute thei ngitngetna nangawn zong manghil in a umta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A itna uleh amudana uh, tualeh athangsietna uh tuin amangthang siengta hi, tualeh ni nuoi a sil kibawlzousie ah, tanvou anei ngai nawn sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pei inlen kipahtah in na ann ne inlen, lung nuomtah in na zu dawn in, aziehpen nasep nabawl zousie, Pasian in ahing pompiehta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Puon ngou ngen sil ngitnget inlen, na lutang sathau nu ngitnget in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ni nuoi a na hinna bangmalou Pasian in, ahing pieh na damsung in na it, na zi toh nuomsatah in um in; aziehpen tuomi na damsung nite a, ni nuoi a na sepginaman ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na khut in bawl ding amu pouma theitawpin sem in; aziehpen na peina ding han sungah nasep ahiei, theina ahiei ahisihleh pilna ahiei, a um sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka kihei a, ni nuoi a ka mu kia khat ahileh: Kitai demna khu agangte ading ahi tuom sih a, kidouna zong mihatte ading ahi tuom sih hi, Ann zong mi pilte ading ahi sih a, Hausatna zong theisiemna neite ading ahi sih a, deisahna zong khutsiem mite ading ahi tuom sih hi. Hinanleh hun leh hunlem amaute zousie tunga tung ahibou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aziehpen mihing in ama hun athei sih hi: len a kiman nga bang leh, thanga kiman vate bangin, mihingte zong atung ua vangsietna hun, thakhat a ahing tun chiengin hun hoiloute ah a awh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua pilna zong ni nuoi ah ka muta a, tuomi kei adingin athupi in ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mi tawmnou khat tenna khopi neu khat a um a, tualeh leeng thupitah khat in ahing sim a, a imkhumta hi, tualeh akimkot ah thang thupitah akam khumta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua khopi sungah mi migenthei pil mama khat a tenga, ama’n apilna in tua khopi ahunkheta hi, hinanleh koiman tua mi zawngpa athei ngitnget sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n ken hatna sangin pilna ahoi zaw hi, ahivangin migenthei pilna simmawin a um a, athugente ngaikhieh in aum sih, ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mi mote lah a vaihawmpa kikou sangin, awlnou nou a mipil thugen akiza thei zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kidouna galvan sangin pilna ahoizaw a, hinanleh mikhiel khat in silhoi tampi asusie hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Thoupi shisaten, gimnamtui bawlpa sathau anamsietsah bangin, gamtat motna neu noukhat in, pilna zatat umna adaisah thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mipil lungtang aziet lam khut ah a um a, hinanleh mi mo lungtang pen aveilam ah a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mi mo in lampi a peilai nangawn in pilna atasam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Vaihawm mi lungthahna, na tunga asou leh na dinmun taisan sin; Aziehpen thunuoilutna in bawlkhelna thupitah asudai leeng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ni nuoi a silhoilou ka mu khat a um hi, vaihawmpa akipat a bawlkhelna pawtkhie khu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Motna nasatah a sangpi ah akikoi a, mi hausate mun ngiem ah atou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Suohte sakol tunga tuong leh, miliente leitunga suoh banga kenga pei ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lei hum tou pouma, atawsa lei hum sungah ake dinga, koipou bang phetvang khu gul in atu ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Suonglahna khuh a suong laidoh mi, suong in aliem dinga, sing eh mi khu, a sing ee in azauthawngsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Heitang abol a akitathiem sihleh, thatanghat zah angai hi. Hinanleh pilna in lawchinna atun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Akihim masanga gul in mi atuh leh, gul himpa phattuomna a um sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mipil kam a thupawtte hepina ahi a, hinanleh mimo kam in ama apumval hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Akam a thute kipatna khu amotna ahia, tualeh ahoulimna tawpna khu agitlou huoi motna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mimo in thu agen tam a, hinanleh mihing koiman bang hing um ding, ahiei chi agenthei sih hi. Ama nua chienga bang hing um ding, ahiei chi koiman agen thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mi mote sepgimna in amauh alungkham sah a, Aziehpen amauten khopi a peidan nangawn athei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aw, gam na leengpa naupang ahi lai in, tualeh zingmawng a na milienten guolnop annkuong alui lai un, na tung agih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aw gam, na leengpa khu miliente tapa ahia a, tualeh na milienten khamna ding hilou a, thahatna dinga ahun tah a guolnopna abawl lai un, na hampha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thasietna ziehin inntung achim a, khut thasete inn ake hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Guolnopna pen nuina dinga kibawl ahi a, tualeh zu in mi akipahsah a, hinanleh sum in tahsapna awng zousie ahu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na lungsim nangawn in leengpa gausap sinlen, na lupna pindan ah mi hausate gense sin. Aziehpen tungleeng va khat in na aw theiin, na thugen agen sawnkha ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tui tungah na tanghou pai in, Ni tampi nua chieng in na mu kia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Sagi kungah tanvou hawm in, ahi giet kungah; Aziehpen leitungah bang sil hoilou hing um ding ahiei, chi na thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Meilumte guotui a adim leh, leitungah guo zusahin akisu awng ua, tualeh sing khat simlam ahiei mallam ahiei a apua leh, apua na mun ah a umden ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hui ngaikhoh zousie’n haichi pawlou ding a, tualeh meilum en en pouma in bu a at ngaisih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hui lampi heisung ahiei, chi leh, nau painu sunga gu leh, taangte bangchidan a hing khangdoh ahiei, chi na theilou mabangin, sil zousie siempa Pasian nasepte na theizou sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zingmawng lam in na haichi tu inlen, nitah lam chiengin na khut khawlsah sin; Aziehpen, heipen ahiei lawchingtah a hing poudoh ding, tami ahiei, tuami ahiei, ahisihleh ani a hing hoi tuoh tuoh ding ahiei, chi na theisih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Adihtah in khovah anuom a, tualeh mit a dingin nisa mu khu anuom hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hinanleh mi kum tampi adam a, tuate zousie a akipah mama leh, mielna nite theizing heh, aziehpen tam mama ding ahi uhi. A hing um ding zousie bangmalou ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aw khanglai, na khangdawnna ah kipah inlen, Na khangdawn lai nite in, na lungtangin hing kipahsah henlen; na lungtang deidan danin um inlen, na mit mu a hoi na sahna lamlam zuiin; Hinanleh tami zousie ziehin, Pasian in thukhenna ah hing zawpi ding ahi; chi thei in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuaziehin na lungtang apat lunggimna koimang inlen, na tahsa apat in silhoilou koimangin, aziehpen naupanlai leh khanglai nite bangmalou ahibou hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ni hoiloute ahing tun a, kum leh hate ahing nai a, atung uah kipahna mawngmawng ka nei sih, na hing china ding hun ahing tun masangin; na khangdawn lai in nang hing siempa thei ngitnget in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ni leh khovah leh ha leh aasite suhmiel a a um a, guo zuh nua a meilumte akitawlmang masangin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Inn ngahte ahing chitut ua, mi hatte ahing kun khiukheu ua, ann sute atawmtah zieh ua akhawl ua, tualeh kotta a dahdohte avahphat nawnlou masangin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh kholai dawngkotte akikha, nailou laiin ann sute thawmgin adai deu deu a, va ham ging a mite athaw chieng in, Tualeh la sa siem tanute zousie aw aheu masangin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Teehse senga munsang kaltou ding giinga, kholai dung zousie zauhuoina ngen a adim a, kawlthualu sing ahing pahlun a, khaukhuppite tunggihna ahing hi a, tualeh lunggulnate abei sienga, mihing in atangtawn innlam zuon a apei a, mishi suunte kholai a apei hun uh atun masangin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh dangka khau ahing kiphel a, sana kuong akeh a, ahisihleh tuikhuh a tuibelte akeh zah a, ahisihleh tuikul a, tui khaina leengpei akisiet masangin, Nang hing siempa thei ngitnget in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Leivui ahina banga ahing kipatna lei a anuakia kia ding a, Tualeh hagau khu apepa Pasian kungah, akia kia ding hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bangmaloute bangmalou, sil zousie bangmalou ngen ahibou hi thugenpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuaban ah, thugenpa ana apil ziehin mite theina ahil nalai hi, Ahi, thupil tampi a ngaituo a, a suidoh a, tualeh akizom ditdet in a guoltuo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thugenpa’n pomtah thute mu tum in asui a, akigielkhete thutah leh thudih ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mipil thugente pen sutna siazum bang ahi a, tualeh misiemte thugente khu, belampu in apieh siatuhkil khetlut bang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh ka tapa aw, tamte ban ah, tam thute ah hilna ngaikhie in; laibu tampi bawl in tawpni anei sih a, zil tam zong tahsa gimna bep ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thu pumpi khupsinna ingaikhe ding uh; Pasian giing inlen, athupiehte zuiin, Aziehpen tami mihingte bawl ding mawng ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aziehpen Pasian in sil kibawl zousie, ahoi leh asia hitaleh, sil kiphuol gu zousie thukhenna mun ah atut ding hi.
  </para>
</usx>
